    <bpmn:process id="W_W5401" name="W5401. Eligible Invoice Batch Selection, Pooling &amp; Submission to Factor" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Invoice issuance (VS-16); scheduled submission cycle
Frequency: Daily/weekly submission batches
Volume: ~3,500 AR invoices/month eligible; ~42,000/yr
Owner: AR/Factoring Operations Lead
Participants: Credit Analyst, Factor/Funder
Source: workflow W5401 — Eligible Invoice Batch Selection, Pooling &amp; Submission to Factor</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5401_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5401_Lane1" name="AR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5401_Lane2" name="Credit Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5401_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5401_Start4" name="Invoice issuance (VS-16); scheduled submission cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5401_Task5" name="Select eligible invoices per criteria (W5395): approved customer, within age…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Select eligible invoices per criteria (W5395): approved customer, within age, undisputed, within concentration.
Responsible (R): AR/Factoring Ops Lead
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5401_Task6" name="Pool into a submission batch with required data (customer, invoice, amount…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pool into a submission batch with required data (customer, invoice, amount, terms, due date).
Responsible (R): AR/Factoring Ops Lead
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5401_Task7" name="Gate eligibility automatically (W5395); exclude ineligible (over-age, disputed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Gate eligibility automatically (W5395); exclude ineligible (over-age, disputed, over-limit).
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5401_Task8" name="Submit the batch to the factor via the factoring platform (W5398); obtain…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Submit the batch to the factor via the factoring platform (W5398); obtain acceptance.
Responsible (R): AR/Factoring Ops Lead
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5401_Task9" name="Record submission and update invoice status to &quot;submitted/assigned&quot; in AR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Record submission and update invoice status to &quot;submitted/assigned&quot; in AR (VS-16).
Responsible (R): AR/Factoring Ops Lead
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5401_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5401_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5401_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5401_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-798 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Sale, Factoring Drawdown, Notification &amp; Cash Application (PA-189.2).) | - operational: double-financing fraud detection with duplicate-submission guard (invoice-level uniqueness check).
Owner: AR/Factoring Operations Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
