    <bpmn:process id="W_W5402" name="W5402. Factor Funding/Drawdown, Advance Posting &amp; Bank Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Factor accepts and funds a submission (W5401)
Frequency: Per submission batch
Volume: ~50 drawdowns/yr (batched)
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Finance, Factor/Funder, Bank
Source: workflow W5402 — Factor Funding/Drawdown, Advance Posting &amp; Bank Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5402_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5402_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5402_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5402_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5402_Start4" name="Factor accepts and funds a submission (W5401)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5402_Task5" name="Receive the factor advance (advance rate × eligible batch) net of fees/reserve…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive the factor advance (advance rate × eligible batch) net of fees/reserve to BuildRight&#x27;s account.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: per drawdown</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5402_Task6" name="Post the advance to cash and the receivables-sale/factoring GL accounts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Post the advance to cash and the receivables-sale/factoring GL accounts (VS-17/VS-157/W5397).
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per drawdown</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5402_Task7" name="Reconcile the advance to the accepted submission and facility terms (rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile the advance to the accepted submission and facility terms (rate, advance, reserve).
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per drawdown</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5402_Task8" name="Update facility utilization and available headroom (W5394).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Update facility utilization and available headroom (W5394).
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: per drawdown</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5402_Task9" name="Investigate and resolve any funding discrepancy with the factor.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Investigate and resolve any funding discrepancy with the factor.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5402_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5402_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5402_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5402_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-798 (ensure controlled execution — Invoice Sale, Factoring Drawdown, Notification &amp; Cash Application (PA-189.2).) | - operational: daily bank/posting reconciliation with month-end close tie-out.
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
