    <bpmn:process id="W_W5405" name="W5405. Non-Recourse Credit Risk Event, Customer Dispute &amp; Short-Pay Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer dispute, short-pay, or credit risk event on a factored invoice
Frequency: Event-driven (~1–5% of submitted invoices become dispute/short-pay/credit events)
Volume: ~1–5% of factored invoices
Owner: Credit Manager
Participants: Factor/Funder, Trade Credit Insurer (VS-68), AR, Customer
Source: workflow W5405 — Non-Recourse Credit Risk Event, Customer Dispute &amp; Short-Pay Handling</bpmn:documentation>
