Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5405_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5405_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
